es product 1 a bigger buffer because a shortage of product 1 costs more relative to leftover stock.\n- **Plan 7:** I cut the day 24 product 1 order to 190 because a larger order could push total stock past the 240-unit limit."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2299, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2378, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2299}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-12T18:17:18.293Z", "request_id": "req_011CfxoP6xizXcJAGdUcdaGa"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01QnJMs9X1rVcLVjbLjGz8T8", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfxoP7BsxzrRvphccoHT5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01QnJMs9X1rVcLVjbLjGz8T8", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"candidates": [{"plan": {"orders": [[57, 58], [0, 0], [45, 116], [0, 0], [38, 106], [0, 0], [58, 65], [0, 0], [53, 96], [0, 0], [35, 124], [0, 0], [72, 87], [0, 0], [55, 110], [0, 0], [44, 136], [0, 0], [36, 122], [0, 0], [56, 75], [0, 0], [50, 110], [0, 0], [35, 142], [0, 0], [19, 100], [0, 0], [0, 0], [0, 0]]}, "claim": 12900, "doubt": 0.35, "note": "Order every 2 days (14 orders) at forecast ×1.12; risk: an occasional demand spike leaves a 2-day shortage."}, {"plan": {"orders": [[62, 63], [0, 0], [49, 127], [0, 0], [41, 116], [0, 0], [63, 71], [0, 0], [57, 105], [0, 0], [38, 135], [0, 0], [78, 95], [0